id: team-buddy
name: Team Buddy
kind: gear
itemType: buddy
special: true
buddyKind: greater
original: any
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Greater, of any ordinary Buddy: given to an Ally at the start of their turn for the Combat
  Encounter.
text: >
  Team Buddy: This amazing buddy helps not only you, but all of your friends, too.
  –Special Buddy Type: Greater
  –Original Buddy: Any (chosen by the ARC ~ cannot be a Special Buddy)
  –Effects: At the start of an Allies’ turn, you may give this Buddy to that Ally for the
  duration of this Combat Encounter. This Buddy remains Active for that Ally.

---

# --- What the table keeps ----------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# Giving it, by the table's ruling: whoever has it adds it to their own sheet, and what happens to
# it after is between them.
